  "title": "German Lemon Cake",
  "description": "This loaf cake is known in Germany as &#39;Zitronenkuchen&#39;, a dense pound cake with a lemon glaze all over the top and soaked into the cake itself.",
  "authors": [
    "MISS ALIX"
  ],
